<title>FRANCE: G des Eaux makes bid for SNCF telecom.</title>
<headline>G des Eaux makes bid for SNCF telecom.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French diversified utility Generale des Eaux said it had made a formal bid on Monday with its German partner Mannesmann to run the telecommunications operations of state-railways SNCF.</p>
<p>Generale des Eaux head Jean-Marie Messier told a news conference the two companies wanted to bring British Telecom to join the bid.</p>
<p>Construction to media group Bouygues has also made an offer jointly with Italy's STET.</p>
</text>
